{"title": "Aegis Palms", "pageid": 28661, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aegis_Palms", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Aegis Palms</b> is a passive feature that protects creatures you heal or revive.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you heal a creature, it gains the effect of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward\" title=\"Blade Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/38px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/50px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blade Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward\" title=\"Blade Ward\">Blade Ward</a>. When you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/25px-Revivify_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/38px-Revivify_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/50px-Revivify_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revive\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/25px-Revivify_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\">Revive</a> a creature it gains the effect of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/38px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/50px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Blade_Ward\"> Condition: Blade Ward </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Blade Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blade Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Blade Ward (Condition)\">Blade Ward</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistance</a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Death_Ward\"> Condition: Death Ward </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\">Death Ward</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The next time damage would reduce the affected entity to 0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>, it remains conscious with 1 Hit Point left.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Reviving_Hands\" title=\"The Reviving Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Gloves_Metal_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Reviving_Hands\" title=\"The Reviving Hands\">The Reviving Hands</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Unlike <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm%27s_Protection\" title=\"Helm's Protection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helm's Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm%27s_Protection\" title=\"Helm's Protection\">Helm's Protection</a> on <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider%27s_Pride\" title=\"Hellrider's Pride\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Gloves_Metal_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider%27s_Pride\" title=\"Hellrider's Pride\">Hellrider's Pride</a>, the Aegis Palms <i>does</i> apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward\" title=\"Blade Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/30px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/40px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blade Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Blade_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Blade_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward\" title=\"Blade Ward\">Blade Ward</a> if the caster heals themselves.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Aegis Palms does not apply Death Ward when Revivify is cast on an already dead ally. Casting it on an ally who is downed, but not yet dead, does apply Death Ward.</li>\n<li>The version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp/20px-Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Death_Ward_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a> granted by Aegis Palms uniquely is not lost upon being triggered. There is no limit to the number of times it can be triggered during its 2 turn duration.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203537\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3509/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33829/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10194/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977211/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.558      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   69.558      1 -total\n 28.40%   19.756     